                            5
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَسَّلَ بِالدَّلْوِ إِلَى المَآءِ</span></b> 
                         [<i>He sought to get at,</i>
or <i>obtain, the water by means of the bucket</i>].
(M in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دلو</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَسَّلَ إِلَيْهِ بِكَذَا</span>
                        <i>He sought
to bring himself near to him, or to approach to
him, to gain access to him, or to advance himself
in his favour, by such a thing:</i> (Msb, &amp;c.:) so
too ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَسَّلَ</span></b> ; (S, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَسَلَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَسِلُ</span>.
(Msb.)

